      "text": "The governing measure of excess is the GPS trace figure, not the rounded copy on the trip record: gps_trace.trace_distance_km is 10.78 km against a booked optimal of 7.2 km, an excess of 3.58 km, or 49.72%. That clears the POL-RD-01 establishment gate (greater than 20% and greater than 0.8 km) but falls short of the materiality gate, because it is neither greater than 50% of the optimal distance nor greater than 8.0 km absolute. The trip_record.deviation_pct of 50.0 is a rounded convenience copy and POL-RD-01 forbids citing it for the threshold test. The deviation is therefore established but NOT material, so the POL-RD-06 repeat-pattern uplift, the FULL_REFUND limb and the driver-conduct referral are not engaged.",
